  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-data-insight",
      "text": "Data analysis toolkit for [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness). Drop a CSV and get instant profiling, anomaly detection, and queryable insights — all without leaving your agent session."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- **`profile_data`** — Column types, missing values, statistics, distributions\n- **`detect_anomalies`** — IQR and z-score outlier detection on numeric columns\n- **`summarize_data`** — Structured overview with quality issues and next-step suggestions\n- **`query_data`** — Filter, group, and aggregate without writing code"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin add github:ClaireXi99/dsh-data-insight\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Usage",
      "text": "Once installed, the tools are available to the agent automatically.\n\n```\n> Profile the sales data in ./data/q3_sales.csv\n\n> Detect anomalies in the \"revenue\" column of report.csv"
    },
    {
      "section": "Supported Formats",
      "text": "- CSV (comma-separated)\n- TSV (tab-separated)\n- JSON (array of objects, or `{data: [...]}` / `{results: [...]}`)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/ClaireXi99/dsh-data-insight.git\ncd dsh-data-insight\nnpm install\nnpm run build"
    },
    {
      "section": "Local dev with DSH",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh web --patch ./dev/cordis.yml\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
  ],
